SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT grant above covers the source code, tests and documentation authored for
this project.

It does NOT cover the files under `data/razorpay-samples/`, which are Razorpay's
own published sample reports, redistributed unmodified for verification purposes
with their source URLs recorded in `data/razorpay-samples/SOURCES.md`. Those
files remain Razorpay's; no licence to them is granted or implied here.
`docs/00-brief.md` likewise quotes Razorpay's published buildathon copy verbatim
for reference and is quoted, not licensed.

---

## Scope of this license

The MIT grant above covers the source code in this repository: everything under
`src/`, `tests/`, `scripts/`, and this project's own documentation prose.

It does **not** extend to two kinds of third-party material vendored here for
verification and citation, neither of which I hold rights to relicense:

- **`data/razorpay-samples/*.xlsx`** — Razorpay's own published sample settlement
  reports, downloaded verbatim from their public documentation
  (`data/razorpay-samples/SOURCES.md` records the exact URLs). Included so the
  closure-identity claim in this project is independently checkable against the
  original files, not a description of them. Razorpay retains whatever rights
  they hold in this data; nothing here purports to grant further rights to it.

- **`docs/00-brief.md`** — a verbatim capture of the Razorpay AI Buildathon
  track descriptions from razorpay.com/buildathon/, kept so the submission can
  be checked against the brief it responds to. Quoted for reference and
  attribution, under the same reasoning that applies to citing any competition's
  own rules in a submission to that competition — not offered under this
  project's MIT terms.

If you fork this repository, treat both as **read but do not redistribute
independently of their original source** unless you have your own rights to
them.
